{"id":"d5ecfacd107be1a9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm.md","title":"PolyTypeInstTerm","display":"PolyTypeInstTerm","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTypeInstTerm","parameters":["c","s","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTypeInstTerm"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 双绑定替换与规约。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>类型 β 替换遍历所有项中类型注解；普通 λ 不增加类型 cutoff。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTypeInstTerm c s t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z2138 (@ PolyTypeInstTermProof c s t u z2138))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"819128e445693b0d\" href=\"?note=819128e445693b0d\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTypeInstTermProof\">PolyTypeInstTermProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTypeInstTerm c s t u)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTypeInstTermProof","status":"resolved","id":"819128e445693b0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PolyTypeInstTermProof|PolyTypeInstTermProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":870,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6df37cab7bc6f11","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm|PolyTypeInstTerm]]"},{"id":"8cd2410805e5b689","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyAny|PolyAny]]；[[ZFC_PolyTermInst|PolyTermInst]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm|PolyTypeInstTerm]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-565","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm|PolyTypeInstTerm]]"},{"id":"feb5357ce56a8ac2","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeInstTerm|PolyTypeInstTerm]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","819128e445693b0d","593f9bdab4d60707"]}